@baseUrl = http://localhost:5081

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Enqueue a deterministic sum. Repeating the same key & body reuses the job.
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "sum",
  "payload": {"numbers": [10, 20, 35.5]},
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-order-1001",
  "maxAttempts": 3
}

### Deliberately fail twice, succeed on third try (after ~2 + 4 seconds).
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "flaky",
  "payload": {"failUntilAttempt": 2},
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-flaky-1002",
  "maxAttempts": 3
}

### A permanently failing job reaches the dead-letter status after 2 tries.
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "flaky",
  "payload": {"failUntilAttempt": 9},
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-dead-1003",
  "maxAttempts": 2
}

### Short bounded work
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "delay",
  "payload": {"milliseconds": 1000},
  "maxAttempts": 3
}

### List most recently queued jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?limit=20

### List jobs that exhausted their automatic retry budget
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?status=dead

### Replace this id with one returned by POST /jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Attempt history; replace the id
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/attempts

### Retry dead job with 3 additional attempts; replace the id
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/retry
